static.solution:
Solution:
Use the Product Rule twice.
\begin{array}{rcl} f'(x) \amp =\amp x^{6} \cdot \frac{d}{dx}[ e^x \sec x] + \frac{d}{dx}[ x^{6} ] \cdot (e^x \sec x) \\ \amp =\amp x^{6}\left( e^x \frac{d}{dx}[ \sec x ] + \frac{d}{dx}[e^x] \sec x \right) + 6 x^{5} (e^x \sec x) \\ \amp =\amp x^{6} (e^x( \sec x \tan x) + e^x \sec x) + 6 x^{5} e^x \sec x \\ \amp =\amp x^{6} e^x( \sec x \tan x) + x^{6} e^x \sec x + 6 x^{5} e^x \sec x \\ \end{array}
